# Airflow environment template.
# Copy this file to .env before running make airflow-init.
#   cp orchestration/.env.example orchestration/.env
#
# WARNING: override ALL credentials below before any shared or production use.
# Never commit orchestration/.env — it is gitignored.

# Your local user ID. Used by Airflow containers to avoid permission issues
# on volume-mounted directories (dags/, logs/, plugins/, config/).
# Find yours with: id -u
AIRFLOW_UID=50000

# Override to disable Airflow's built-in example DAGs (recommended for production).
# AIRFLOW__CORE__LOAD_EXAMPLES=false

# Override with a generated Fernet key for production deployments.
# Generate one with:
#   python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())"
# AIRFLOW__CORE__FERNET_KEY=your-generated-key-here

# Override the default webserver credentials before any shared deployment.
# _AIRFLOW_WWW_USER_USERNAME=airflow
# _AIRFLOW_WWW_USER_PASSWORD=airflow
